PROJ 'xxxxx' 'caxx' 
$ NONSTATIONARY 
SET level=0 NAUTICAL
MODE NONSTationary TWODimensional 
COORDINATES CARTESIAN  
$ 
CGRID   463400 4376500 0 12600 4000 63 20 CIRCLE 72 0.0345 1.00  34 
$ 
INPGRID   BOTTOM  REGULAR 463400 4376500 0 63 20 200 200 EXC -1.0 
READINP   BOTTOM 1 'bathy/bottom_ca00_matrix.dat' 1 0 FREE
$ 
$ NO WIND, you can activate it 
$ Input Boundary Conditions: one point
BOUN SHAPE JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK  DSPR  DEGREES 
BOUN  SIDE N CON FILE 'pathN.txt'
BOUN  SIDE W CON FILE 'pathW.txt'
BOUN  SIDE E CON FILE 'pathE.txt'
BOUN  SIDE S CON FILE 'pathS.txt'
$
INITIAL
$
$ here a simple configuration.
OFF QUAD 
OFF WCAP 
GEN1 
BREA 
FRICTION JONSWAP 
$
PROP BSBT

$$$$$OUTPUT2$$$$$
$ output timestamp requested every 1h 
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEAD 'path.mat' LAY 3 XP YP DEP HSIGN TM02 RTP DIR OUTPUT 20260907.000000 1 HR

$$$$$OUTPUT3$$$$$
$ variables evolution in time for a point:
POINTS 'POINT' 469331 4378762
TABle 'POINT' HEADER 'path.txt' TIME XP YP DEP HSIGN TM02 RTP DIR OUTPUT 20260907.000000 1 HR
